ossible Gray codes for `n` bits using recursion. * `find_strongest_gray_code(gray_codes)`: Finds the strongest Gray code by iterating through the list of codes and keeping track of the maximum consecutive ones. The example usage demonstrates how to use these functions to generate all possible Gray codes for 4 bits and find the strongest one."
